Column name: Abbreviation Type: TEXT Description: author abbreviation, eg 'Park et al 2009'
Column name: Year Type: NUMBER Description: publication year, eg '1998'
Column name: Pubmed Type: TEXT Description: PubMed identifier, if available, eg '17334343'
Column name: TitleLength Type: NUMBER Description: length of title, up to 334
